[{"id":3109591154,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc65WJhy","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Sounds like it's an improvement over `master`. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nMy 2c, I'd say this keeps https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107095 at \"Bad\" as a release blocker, since it doesn't fully fix it.\r\n\r\n> Ok... but what about fixing this further? Unfortunately, it's not really possible to do that. \r\n> The only solution I can think of to fix this further would be to use 128-bit floats instead of 64-bit floats, store the step size in 128-bit, do the math in 128-bit, and then store the computed value as 64-bit.\r\n\r\nThere's a better solution: Store `step_size` as a [fixed-point number](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fixed-point_arithmetic). This should allow us to store the exact value the user entered in UI (e.g. `0.01`), instead of a floating point approximation, and snap the values for storage (e.g. `FixedPoint snap(double val, FixedPoint snap)`) accurately as well. I think this is more appropriate than a 128 bit float.\r\n\r\nThis does not require c++20, but it _does_ require quite a lot more implementation work. So it may not be an option for 4.5.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109100#pullrequestreview-3109591154","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109100","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109100#pullrequestreview-3109591154"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109100"}},"submitted_at":"2025-08-12T09:37:21Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3109608189,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc65WNr9","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109100#pullrequestreview-3109608189","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109100","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109100#pullrequestreview-3109608189"},"pu